**Closed, with the lines they rest on**
- Automatic default branch resolution answers from the cached remote HEAD and runs the live ls-remote in the background (`backend/internal/adapters/workspace/gitworktree/workspace.go:2051`) — Faster session start. A renamed remote default is picked up one start later. An AO-initialized repo whose remote just received its first push is not picked up inside the window (see finding). If it fails: Background lookup failure is logged through w.logf and the attempt stays recorded for 10 minutes. The cached default is kept, so nothing is lost. With no cache, Resolve failure propagates as before. Evidence: `backend/internal/adapters/workspace/gitworktree/workspace.go:2051-2070`, `backend/internal/adapters/workspace/gitworktree/workspace.go:2074-2086`, `backend/internal/gitdefault/resolver.go:94-111`, `backend/internal/gitdefault/resolver.go:201-225`.
